Package: difftastic
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, shared-mime-info
Description: structural diff tool that compares files by their syntax
 difft parses files with tree-sitter and diffs the syntax trees, so it
 understands moved code, reformatting and nesting. Built by depot from the
 upstream release.
